# core/

Shared cross-feature primitives for ${PROJECT_NAME}. Anything that more than
one feature depends on lives here.

## Subfolders

| Subfolder | What lives here |
| --- | --- |
| [`di/`](di/) | Manual DI graph (`AppGraph.kt`) wired by `MainApplication`. No Hilt by design. |
| [`ui/`](ui/) | Shared Compose pieces — theme, design-system primitives. |
| [`data/`](data/) | Shared data sources (`NetworkClient`). One Retrofit instance, shared. |
| [`domain/`](domain/) | Shared domain models / value types used by multiple features. |

## What does NOT live here

- Feature-specific UI / VMs / repos — those live under `features/<name>/`.
- Navigation — that lives under `navigation/`.

